 {
  "id": "tab",
  "type": "tab",
  "label": "hamon POC: scheduled KNX write",
  "disabled": false,
  "info": "Publishes to hamon's MQTT command topic knx/<site>/<g>/<a>/<d>/write.\nhamon converts the payload by the GA's DPT (DPT1: On/Off/1/0/true).\nretain MUST stay false or hamon replays the write on every reconnect.\nTopic is a placeholder until a real site + safe GA is chosen."
